{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1825","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. LuoTianyi and the Palindrome String"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"LuoTianyi gives you "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a palindrome"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\dagger}$$$ string $$$s$$$, and she wants you to find out the length of the longest non-empty subsequence$$$^{\\ddagger}$$$ of $$$s$$$ which is not a palindrome string. If there is no such subsequence, output $$$-1$$$ instead."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\dagger}$$$ A palindrome is a string that reads the same backward as forward. For example, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abccba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are palindromes, but strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"reality"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\ddagger}$$$ A string $$$a$$$ is a subsequence of a string $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by deletion of several (possibly, zero or all) characters from $$$b$$$. For example, strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are subsequences of string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abaab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", but strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"codeforces"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bbb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"h"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test consists of multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and the only line of each test case contains a single string $$$s$$$ ($$$1 \\le |s| \\le 50$$$) consisting of lowercase English letters — the string that LuoTianyi gives you. It's guaranteed that $$$s$$$ is a palindrome string."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the length of the longest non-empty subsequence which is not a palindrome string. If there is no such subsequence, output $$$-1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\nabacaba\naaa\ncodeforcesecrofedoc\nlol\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n-1\n18\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is a subsequence of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abacaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as we can delete the third letter of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abacaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" to get \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is not a palindrome string. We can prove that \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abcaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is an example of the longest subsequences of \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abacaba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" that isn't palindrome, so that the answer is $$$6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, we can only get \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", but they are all palindrome strings, so the answer is $$$-1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1825A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1825/problem/A"}